Non-individual names, like ones that you give when prompted for a name to
the scroll you just read, don't get saved in bones files. The name
randomized in the new game (where the bones are loaded) would be shown
instead. 
And when you name a scroll individually, it still shows the scroll type
name (randomized, identified or non-individually named).

